    <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVicccO959lD_A00PgpZrZtGNRM.jpg"><p><span>「hyrox比赛结束啦，趁着还没忘干净赶紧来聊两句！」</span></p><p><strong><span>｜关注我们｜</span></strong></p><p><span>大脑跑不赢四肢 </span><strong><span>王大可</span></strong><span> 🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>王大可小爬菜</span></strong></p><p><span>健身也健脑 </span><strong><span>琪刘海儿 </span></strong><span>🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>卡戴憨</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>｜本期简介｜</span></strong></p><p><span>从24年开始在国内落地，到今年场场爆满，社交媒体上的健身博主仿佛一夜之间都开始了推雪橇。老刘终于没忍住上了场，然后攒了一肚子话要来女更衣室倒一倒——从站点的参赛氛围、项目难度，到比赛当天连滚带爬的全流程复盘，再到"什么样的人适合玩hyrox"、“这项运动是否科学”。</span><br><strong><span>｜内容导览｜</span></strong><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="183">00:03:03</a>hyrox怎么突然这么火了？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">00:09:44</a>  你怎么不声不响地就报名了？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">00:14:24</a> 赛前做了什么训练计划？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1230">00:20:30</a> 饮食计划呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1479">00:24:39</a> 装备也说说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1577">00:26:17</a> 真正比赛和训练有啥不同？</span></p><p><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1847">00:30:47</a> 突发状况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1992">00:33:12</a> 最恨的项目</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2374">00:39:34</a>  有没有所谓的“防受伤功能性训练”</span></p><p><span>现场听友提问</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2579">00:42:59</a>  平时没有训练过可以参加hyrox比赛吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2721">00:45:21</a> hyrox比赛会不会很容易受伤呢？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2895">00:48:15</a>  hyrox这项运动真的科学吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3089">00:51:29</a> hyrox比赛提前多久准备比较合适？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3823">01:03:43</a>  嘱咐点啥</span></p><p><span>BGM:从头再来-刘欢</span></p><p><span>「后台持续开放投稿，欢迎分享你在健身、运动、生活上的各种有趣经历」</span></p><p><span>如果你喜欢「