  <item>
    <title>Ep36.聊聊过度训练：你是在自律，还是纵欲？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69e8a2821e94ae6921e40e22</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69e8a2821e94ae6921e40e22</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 22 Apr 2026 10:38:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVicccO959lD_A00PgpZrZtGNRM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>「明明是想变好，怎么越练身体越差？明明累得想死，为什么就是不敢休息？」</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜关注我们｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>女更衣室</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>健身也健脑 </span><strong><span>琪刘海儿</span></strong><span> 🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>卡戴憨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大脑跑不赢四肢 </span><strong><span>王大可</span></strong><span> 🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>王大可小爬菜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期简介｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>试问各位谁没有训练到上头的时候把自己玩坏过？这期我们就来聊聊“过度训练”。不是说练多了就叫过度训练，而是你给身体的压力和给它的恢复没对上账。原来身体根本分不清你是在举铁还是在加班，它只看压力总值。你以为你在训练，其实是在作si。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你最近也觉得自己越练越废、莫名其妙烦躁、对健身房有点犯怵……先别急着骂自己懒，说不定是身体在求救。听完这期，你会知道什么时候该练，什么时候该理直气壮地躺平。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜内容导览｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 纯纵欲分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="493">08:13</a> 过度训练的后果 （吓得人睡不着）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a> 何为过度训练？</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9zY25lcHVlZDNtb2ouZmVpc2h1LmNuL3NwYWNlL2FwaS9ib3gvc3RyZWFtL2Rvd25sb2FkL2FzeW5jY29kZS8_Y29kZT1aV05pWXpSak16Y3dZVGd6TURBeE1qSmpOakU1WVRrMU1tSTVNREkzTnpaZlEwdE1Sa0pSVDNkRVEzTk1Ua2R3ZDFGSFVXNUtRMDVPY2tseVRWaEhZWEpmVkc5clpXNDZSSHBZZG1KbldGVkViekJJT1hsNFoxRjFVR015TW5wS2JuTjNYekUzTnpZNE5UTXdNRGc2TVRjM05qZzFOall3T0Y5V05B"></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> 功能性过载</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a> 非功能性过载</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a> 过度训练综合征</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1352">22:32</a> 身体的压力来源不分“好坏”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1933">32:13</a> 很多人其实在“用训练对抗生活失控”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2393">39:53</a> 过度训练，本质是“恢复羞耻”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2812">46:52</a> 附赠：自评清单</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:Don't Forget to Breathe-Zancore/lckiara&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>「后台持续开放投稿，欢迎分享你在健身、运动、生活上的各种有趣经历」</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢「女更衣室」，欢迎在小宇宙给我们打赏，打赏收入会全部用于中国社会福利基金会的“女生加油计划”。</span></p>]]></description>
