  <item>
    <title>Ep34.补矿有策略，拒绝拼多多</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69a830dbe46749707ff8c2ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69a830dbe46749707ff8c2ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 04 Mar 2026 13:27:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVicccO959lD_A00PgpZrZtGNRM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>「说那么一大堆，不如来点实际的。本期送上喂饭式“矿物质补充计划表”，请大家自行取用！」</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜关注我们｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🍠红薯：@女更衣室</span></p><span></span><p><span>健身也健脑 </span><strong><span>琪刘海儿</span></strong><span> 🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>卡戴憨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大脑跑不赢四肢 </span><strong><span>王大可</span></strong><span> 🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>王大可小爬菜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期简介｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期女更，我们把零碎的矿物质知识，整理成一个“现实可执行的周期模板”。运动日，补的是钾和镁的电位差；休息日，是铁吸收的最好时机；经期，是一次小型营养负债周。夏天的问题不在胃口差吃得少，而在丢得快；冬天的问题不在流失多，而在吸收变慢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>放心，这期我们不说“多吃点什么”，我们讲——什么时候补？补多少？怎么错开？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜内容导览｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>&nbsp;<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> </span></strong><span>补矿关我蛋白质什么事啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span>矿物质都从哪里来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="289">04:49</a> 铁：红肉！动物肝脏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="497">08:17</a> 镁：南瓜籽、全谷物、豆、黑巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="628">10:28</a> 钙：奶制品、强化植物奶、带骨小鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="839">13:59</a> 钾：香蕉、土豆、椰子水、豆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="936">15:36</a> 锌：海鲜、红肉、鸡蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1318">21:58</a> 补矿需要注意啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a> 运动日/周要怎么补？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2753">45:53</a> 经期要怎么补？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3461">57:41</a> 夏天/冬天要怎么补？</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:亲爱的你啊-任素汐</span></p><span></span><p><span>「后台持续开放投稿，欢迎分享你在健身、运动、生活上的各种有趣经历」</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢「女更衣室」，欢迎在小宇宙给我们打赏，打赏收入会全部用于中国社会福利基金会的“女生加油计划”。</span></p>]]></description>
