    <title>Ep32.累吗？心烦吗？恢复慢吗？看看你的矿物质余额吧</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/698cbe94a22480add6c48f2a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">698cbe94a22480add6c48f2a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Feb 2026 18:14:38 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVicccO959lD_A00PgpZrZtGNRM.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>「抽筋睡不着是缺镁？不贫血就是不缺铁？补钙就是喝牛奶？矿物质的补充真就这么简单吗？」</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜关注我们｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>女更衣室</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>大脑跑不赢四肢 </span><strong><span>王大可</span></strong><span> 🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>王大可小爬菜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>健身也健脑 </span><strong><span>琪刘海儿 </span></strong><span>🍠红薯：@</span><strong><span>卡戴憨</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜本期简介｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>本期女更我们来聊聊关于现代人吃喝不愁但“细胞饿肚子”这件事，一起重新研究一下小镁、钙子、和老铁三位“矿物质劳模”的真实身份。为啥缺了它们你会累得想骂人、心率乱飙、手脚冻成冰块？听完你会直拍大腿：原来累是真的，缺也是真的，真不是我不行！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>｜内容导览｜</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> “热量够”不等于“营养够“</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="754">12:34</a> 现代人的刺杀小镁计划</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1175">19:35</a> 缺镁的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1228">20:28</a> 女性比男性更容易缺镁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1616">26:56</a> 钙除了管骨头还管啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1940">32:20</a> 为什么现代人容易缺钙？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a> 缺钙的隐性表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2541">42:21</a> 怎么补钙呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2752">45:52</a> 铁是负责干嘛的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3303">55:03</a> 缺铁在运动上的表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3473">57:53</a> 补铁？补铁？补铁！</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:好风吹进生活里-房东的猫</span></p><span></span><p><span>「后台持续开放投稿，欢迎分享你在健身、运动、生活上的各种有趣经历」</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你喜欢「女更衣室」，欢迎在小宇宙给我们打赏，打赏收入会全部用于中国社会福利基金会的“女生加油计划”。</span></p>]]></description>
